WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
But where Brother Fanghan and the others will go is very simple

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,320
Since they want resources

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:08,200
I'll definitely go to our cabin and search for it. Let's go back soon and maybe we can meet him.

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:13,890
Not in our house

5
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:16,930
They are looking for Baiya to die.

6
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:18,890
Go around from the forest on the side to behind them

7
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,820
These guys actually made it out alive

8
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,980
Maybe it's luck

9
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,020
The door was almost cracked to begin with.

10
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,500
At most, they only have A-level weapons.

11
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,020
It's an S-class weapon

12
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,140
I'm not afraid either

13
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,060
Four little dolls opposite

14
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,540
We are two adults

15
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,300
Besides, I also bring Heavenly Father with me
